  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong Plastics Innovation Hub</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mekong Plastics Innovation Hub expands the CSIRO Indo-Pacific Plastics Innovation Network (IPPIN) to the Mekong subregion. IPPIN is an initiative to bridge the gap between research and investment to reduce plastic waste in the Indo-Pacific.  The initiative has three key objectives; expansion of the circular economy, with enhanced innovation capability around turning plastics into a resource; degradation is reduced, the plastics industry reduces its carbon footprint, and environments are cleaner; and regional cooperation and collaboration is enhanced, health and wellbeing are improved, and local cultural practice and heritage are valued and protected.</narrative>
  </description>
